<title>HONG KONG: SBC Warburg names Asia equities managing director.</title>
<headline>SBC Warburg names Asia equities managing director.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Warburg said on Tuesday it had appointed Anthony Galliers-Pratt as a managing director of its equities division in the Asia-Pacific region.</p>
<p>Galliers-Pratt, who will join SBC Warburg in July, will report to Huw Jenkins and Gordon Dickinson, the joint heads of Asia-Pacific equities, it said in a statement. He will be based in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>Galliers-Pratt spent eight years with BZW, where he was head of Japanese equities for the past five years, it said.</p>
<p>SBC Warburg is the investment banking division of Swiss Bank Corp.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
